ing is the primary visual focus and creates the sense of exclusivity."}, {"id": "placeholder_docs_owgt_placeholder_spec_identity_lockup", "label": "Top-Left OWGT Identity Lockup", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "placeholder/docs/owgt-placeholder-spec.md", "source_location": "L70,L74", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "'OWGT' larger, stacked over 'OneWorldGreaterTogether' smaller, both in blue."}, {"id": "placeholder_docs_owgt_placeholder_spec_form_behavior", "label": "Form Behavior (validation, dummy submit, success state)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "placeholder/docs/owgt-placeholder-spec.md", "source_location": "L88-L92", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Email must contain @ and .; the submit is a dummy function with no persistence (localStorage or backend deferred)."}, {"id": "placeholder_docs_owgt_placeholder_spec_share_functionality", "label": "Share Functionality (Web Share API + clipboard fallback)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "placeholder/docs/owgt-placeholder-spec.md", "source_location": "L94-L98", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "No social share modal - keep it simple with native sharing or clipboard."}, {"id": "placeholder_docs_owgt_placeholder_spec_responsive_strategy", "label": "Responsive Strategy (desktop / tablet / mobile)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "placeholder/docs/owgt-placeholder-spec.md", "source_location": "L100-L103", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Light scroll acceptable on iPhone SE; 16px minimum body text and 48px minimum touch targets."}, {"id": "placeholder_docs_owgt_placeholder_spec_animation_motion", "label": "Animation & Motion (draw-in, boil 0.3, hover re-sketch)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "placeholder/docs/owgt-placeholder-spec.md", "source_